      "writtenOn": "2022-10-07T23:35:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see a bigger problem then. We don\u0027t set CONFIG_ macros when building ectool. That is, ectool is agnostic about the board (but aware of ARCH\u003dx64/arm) because ectool is built with BOARD\u003dhost.\n\nAlso, enum panic_arch is defined in panic.h. Is it exported (like ec_commands.h)?",
      "parentUuid": "548fe108_8217077f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 210,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 210,
        "endChar": 46
      },
      "revId": "10943e00138a364ad4dfd1745423e545285227bb",
