      "writtenOn": "2022-10-10T17:10:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When you do `make buildall`, it will build the utils for each board. I\u0027m not sure if the resulting binaries are being used anywhere. For example, the [`ec-utils` ebuild`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/third_party/chromiumos-overlay/chromeos-base/ec-utils/ec-utils-9999.ebuild;l\u003d33-35;drc\u003d014828648575cc6b45002003c9ce8b58054e25ca) seems to set `BOARD\u003dhost`.\n\nI filed a bug for this issue: http://b/252817153.",
      "parentUuid": "1a029785_16df77d3",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 210,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 210,
        "endChar": 46
      },
      "revId": "10943e00138a364ad4dfd1745423e545285227bb",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e5cdca21_3f6e8fbd",
        "filename": "util/ec_panicinfo.cc",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 210,
