        "id": 1106949
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-10T17:15:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks. I\u0027ll follow-up on the bug. In short, I think we should make buildall build ectool only for BOARD\u003dhost.",
